@startuml
[*] --> ViewTime
state "View time" as ViewTime
state "Adjust hour" as AdjustHour
state "Adjust minutes" as AdjustMinutes
state "Alarm hour" as AlarmHour
state "Alarm minutes" as AlarmMinutes

ViewTime --> AdjustHour : press button to adjust hour
AdjustHour --> ViewTime : press button to view time
ViewTime --> AdjustMinutes : press button to adjust minutes
AdjustMinutes --> ViewTime : press button to view time
ViewTime --> AlarmHour : press button to set alarm hour
AlarmHour --> ViewTime : press button to view time
ViewTime --> AlarmMinutes : press button to set alarm minutes
AlarmMinutes --> ViewTime : press button to view time

state "Increase values" as IncreaseValues
AdjustHour --> IncreaseValues : increase value
AdjustMinutes --> IncreaseValues : increase value
AlarmHour --> IncreaseValues : increase value
AlarmMinutes --> IncreaseValues : increase value

state "Turn on/off alarm" as TurnOnOffAlarm
ViewTime --> TurnOnOffAlarm : press button to turn on/off alarm
TurnOnOffAlarm --> ViewTime : press button to view time

state "Trigger alarm" as TriggerAlarm
AlarmHour --> TriggerAlarm : set alarm hour matches current time
TriggerAlarm --> ViewTime : press button to view time

state "Stop alarm" as StopAlarm
ViewTime --> StopAlarm : press button to stop alarm
StopAlarm --> ViewTime : press button to view time

state "Turn on/off light" as TurnOnOffLight
ViewTime --> TurnOnOffLight : press button to turn on/off light
TurnOnOffLight --> ViewTime : press button to view time

TurnOnOffAlarm --> TriggerAlarm : alarm is turned on
TriggerAlarm --> StopAlarm : set alarm hour matches current time
StopAlarm --> ViewTime : press button to view time
TurnOnOffLight --> TurnOnOffAlarm : turn off light when turning off alarm
TurnOnOffAlarm --> TurnOnOffLight : turn on light when turning on alarm

@enduml
